        "text_8pqpbA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>FADILAL is not a massage candle. It is body care in candle form: you light it, let it melt, and pour the warm oil onto your skin.</p><p><strong>Warm oil, not hot wax</strong><br/>Melts at a low temperature, just above body temperature.</p><p><strong>Plant-based waxes</strong><br/>Beeswax, coconut wax and soy wax. No paraffin.</p><p><strong>No paraffin</strong><br/>Made without paraffin.</p><p><strong>Scent for the room, care for the skin</strong><br/>A calming scent while it melts, soft skin after you pour.</p>",
